### Ready-to-run requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP client)
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Create a record
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "p-1001",
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "description": "Ergonomic 2.4GHz wireless mouse with silent clicks",
  "category": "electronics",
  "tags": ["computer", "accessories"],
  "price": 19.99,
  "stock": 150
}

### Create a record with an auto-generated id
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "USB-C Hub",
  "description": "7-in-1 hub with HDMI and card reader",
  "category": "electronics",
  "tags": ["computer"],
  "price": 34.9,
  "stock": 25
}

### Bulk create
POST {{base}}/products/bulk
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"id":"p-1002","name":"Mechanical Keyboard","description":"RGB backlit mechanical keyboard, blue switches","category":"electronics","tags":["computer","gaming"],"price":79.5,"stock":40},
  {"id":"p-1003","name":"Gaming Headset","description":"Surround sound headset with noise cancelling mic","category":"electronics","tags":["gaming","audio"],"price":59,"stock":0},
  {"id":"p-2001","name":"Coffee Mug","description":"Ceramic mug, 350ml","category":"kitchen","tags":["home"],"price":8.99,"stock":300}
]

### Get by id
GET {{base}}/products/p-1001

### Search: full text (typo tolerant)
GET {{base}}/products/search?q=wirless mous

### Search: filters + sort
GET {{base}}/products/search?category=electronics&inStock=true&minPrice=10&maxPrice=100&sortBy=price&order=asc

### Search: by tags, paginated
GET {{base}}/products/search?tags=gaming,audio&page=1&size=5

### Search: list everything
GET {{base}}/products/search

### Edit (partial update)
PATCH {{base}}/products/p-1001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 17.49, "stock": 0 }

### Update (full replace)
PUT {{base}}/products/p-2001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Travel Mug", "category": "kitchen", "price": 12.5, "stock": 80 }

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/products/p-2001
